    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu",
        "text": "...Can I help you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "(Hold up. Check the mug over there. I got a bad feeling about him.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "(Some Lungmen triad? Mr. Capone says they're a bunch of pushovers.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "I got a question for ya."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "We don't want any trouble, right? Just give us a clean answer and we'll be on our way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_272_strong_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jaye",
        "text": "...There's blood on your knuckles."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_272_strong_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "Oh, pardon me. I was cleaning out the trash earlier."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "But a couple of upright citizens like yourselves, you ain't trash, are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu",
        "text": "Is that a threat?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "You're a smart girl, you can figure it out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu",
        "text": "Then I refuse to help you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "...refuse?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "I think that came out wrong, girly."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "It sounded like you said you were dumpster garbage eager to get beaten half to death in that alleyway over there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_272_strong_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jaye",
        "text": "Waai Fu, I'm pretty sure that scream I just heard was..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu",
        "text": "Was 'garbage,' the word you just used?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu",
        "text": "Because one must be thorough and prepared for all eventualities, I will ask one more question: is that how you refer to the people here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "I don't got time to waste talkin' shit with you, start talk\u2014\u2014"
